[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_3p4cv")
fish_name = "Sword Fish"
grade = 4
sprite = ExtResource("2_asthi")
catch_blurb = "Is there a convention in town?"
description = "CAUTION! This species is quite dangerous due to its long and sharp appendage. While the species is widely known to be docile, several tourists have tried to hold them by their tails with their blade-like noses pointed towards the sky. Following such a provocation, this fish will absolutely employ its defenses against your whole, and then your quarters, and then your quarters’ quarters, and so on. May Marvin rest in peace.

Swordfish are nocturnal. They are best observed from afar, where the moonlight reflects off of their metallic exoskeletons as they “joust” about. If you’re lucky, you may observe a friendly duel between them. If a Swordfish cannot find a more suitable spot to sleep during the day, it will drift underneath a legion of Man o’ Wars, where its exoskeleton protects it from stings.

F.I.S.H.E. has recently managed to create a drug that makes Swordfish active during the day, thus converting their behavior from nocturnal to diurnal. A side effect of this drug is increased aggression. Still, they have announced plans to permanently convert them for the sake of spicing up the tournament. Because F.I.S.H.E. also uses the tournament grounds for their experiments, you can expect these fish to be quite common this season—and for your reaction time to involuntarily improve."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cr3nmjdvpgh0a"
